    "e0ac7ad8de1b9d9f089724612ad339dd4da56df243718dc905698adf3ea2b921": {
      "normalizationVersion": 1,
      "sourceHash": "e6fb9056754cbb656f884ef23f46187ee165b434aa6fadfbb683f961e6830214",
      "contextFingerprint": "e9c7aed19b77e2eddb45a7a28450ecfdbb1ca35194ddd3c45675b5f71dcdeee9",
      "sourceText": "Nav2中通过的`nav2_lifecycle_manager`功能包下的`lifecycle_manager`节点管理其他节点的生命周期状态转换。`lifecycle_manager`节点通过ROS 2的生命周期节点（Lifecycle Node）机制，提供了一种标准化的方法来控制Nav2中各个节点的状态转换。这些状态包括未配置（Unconfigured）、非活动（Inactive）、活动（Active）和结束（Finalized）等。通过精细控制这些状态转换，`lifecycle_manager`节点能够确保Nav2系统的各个部分在正确的时机启动、运行和停止，从而提高系统的可靠性和稳定性。",
      "translatedText": "In Nav2, through the`nav2_lifecycle_manager`under the package`lifecycle_manager`node manages the lifecycle state transitions of other nodes\\.`lifecycle_manager`Through the ROS 2 lifecycle node mechanism, nodes provide a standardized method to control the state transitions of each node in Nav2\\. These states include Unconfigured, Inactive, Active, and Finalized\\. Through fine\\-grained control of these state transitions,`lifecycle_manager`nodes can ensure that all parts of the Nav2 system start, run, and stop at the correct times, thereby improving the reliability and stability of the system\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 242,
        "outputTokens": 119,
        "costUsd": 0.000216
      }
    },
